WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪ Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away ♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪ Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway ♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪ Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free ♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪ If time would spare me
just one breath to stay ♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪ If you could see
the depth of my belief ♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪ Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me ♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪ Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form ♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪ I've walked
through life and death before ♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪ I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause ♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪ In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed ♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪ But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost ♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪ Forged in stardust and flame ♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪ I rise with an unyielding frame ♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 10=

01:46.440 --> 01:48.360
(Shen Residence)

01:48.440 --> 01:50.200
Young Master, Madam,
please enjoy the tea.

01:59.640 --> 02:00.160
Zhenzhen,

02:00.840 --> 02:01.720
be honest with me,

02:01.800 --> 02:02.960
has anyone given you a hard time

02:03.040 --> 02:04.000
during your confinement?

02:04.440 --> 02:05.280
Don't worry, Huaijin.

02:05.800 --> 02:06.760
Though I was confined,

02:07.360 --> 02:09.479
I've actually been
more at ease than usual.

02:11.640 --> 02:14.040
Huaijin, you've been with
the Crown Prince daily.

02:14.640 --> 02:15.760
Have you noticed

02:15.840 --> 02:17.320
any unusual behavior from him lately?

02:18.920 --> 02:20.000
Nothing out of the ordinary.

02:20.840 --> 02:21.920
Have you noticed something?

02:22.480 --> 02:23.520
Chancellor and Lady Jiang

02:23.600 --> 02:25.040
have been away for several days now.

02:25.960 --> 02:26.480
What?

02:27.080 --> 02:29.280
Lady Jiang's maid is
guarding Zhengchun Boudoir,

02:30.040 --> 02:32.240
but Chancellor and Zhan Lu
are nowhere to be seen.

02:32.960 --> 02:33.960
It struck me as odd,

02:34.360 --> 02:35.840
so I had my contacts investigate.

02:36.440 --> 02:37.280
That's when I learned

02:37.760 --> 02:39.400
there's no one in Lady Jiang's boudoir

02:40.240 --> 02:40.960
besides her maid.

02:42.040 --> 02:44.240
I suspect this has something
to do with the Crown Prince,

02:44.320 --> 02:46.200
which is why I called you here
to talk about it.

02:46.560 --> 02:47.920
How many days have they been gone?

02:49.680 --> 02:50.840
By my count,

02:51.920 --> 02:52.880
it's been five days.

02:57.960 --> 02:59.240
We shouldn't jump to conclusions.

02:59.920 --> 03:01.600
I'll have someone
look into it discreetly.

03:02.680 --> 03:03.360
You stay alert.

03:03.680 --> 03:05.320
If anything changes, send word at once.

03:06.040 --> 03:06.560
Understood.

03:21.440 --> 03:22.800
It's all because of us

03:23.600 --> 03:25.280
that you were confined
by Chancellor Shen.

03:29.400 --> 03:30.640
Don't worry about Yuetao.

03:30.840 --> 03:32.200
I've sent people to bring her back.

03:32.520 --> 03:34.040
She's safe now in Meng Residence.

03:37.520 --> 03:38.320
But you…

03:41.920 --> 03:42.920
Don't blame yourself.

03:44.560 --> 03:45.680
As a daughter of Meng family,

03:47.680 --> 03:48.720
this is simply my fate.

03:54.280 --> 03:55.040
I'll find a way

03:55.280 --> 03:58.000
to get Chancellor Shen to lift your
restrictions as soon as possible.

04:14.320 --> 04:16.160
Are you even doing your job?

04:16.480 --> 04:17.200
It's been so long,

04:18.440 --> 04:19.680
and yet you haven't found them.

04:21.040 --> 04:22.960
Your Highness, we've deployed
all available men.

04:23.240 --> 04:24.360
Yujing City isn't that large.

04:24.640 --> 04:25.200
I'm sure…

04:25.560 --> 04:27.000
I'm sure we'll hear something soon.

04:27.280 --> 04:29.120
But the fact remains,
you haven't found them.

04:40.600 --> 04:41.120
Stop!

04:44.480 --> 04:45.000
Huaijin.

04:46.320 --> 04:47.000
What have upset you

04:47.080 --> 04:48.360
so much this time, Your Highness?

04:50.160 --> 04:50.680
Nothing.

04:51.120 --> 04:53.200
Just incompetent subordinates
failing their duties.

04:55.160 --> 04:56.120
Leave us.

04:57.320 --> 04:57.840
Wait.

05:00.120 --> 05:00.640
You.

05:02.120 --> 05:03.920
Inform the workers at the silver mine.

05:04.960 --> 05:05.800
I want

05:06.680 --> 05:08.360
500,000 taels extracted in five days.

05:09.400 --> 05:10.160
Five days?

05:10.800 --> 05:11.760
Your Highness…

05:11.920 --> 05:12.520
You mustn't.

05:16.160 --> 05:16.920
Yes, Your Highness.

05:24.560 --> 05:26.320
Your Highness,
please reconsider your order.

05:26.880 --> 05:28.320
Though His Majesty turned a blind eye

05:28.560 --> 05:29.800
to the gambling house incident,

05:30.120 --> 05:31.080
he surely suspects

05:31.320 --> 05:32.360
your involvement.

05:32.880 --> 05:34.600
Now is the time for discretion.

05:34.800 --> 05:36.400
We cannot afford another overt move.

05:38.600 --> 05:39.400
Rise.

05:58.200 --> 06:00.000
I understand your frustration,
Your Highness,

06:02.840 --> 06:03.720
but

06:04.760 --> 06:05.720
haste makes waste.

06:08.400 --> 06:09.200
These days,

06:10.960 --> 06:12.640
we must act with caution.

06:29.080 --> 06:29.600
Huaijin,

06:30.560 --> 06:31.720
you're exemplary in all ways,

06:33.320 --> 06:35.040
but you're overly cautious.

06:36.520 --> 06:37.880
Do you know

06:38.000 --> 06:40.320
why Father didn't press further
about the gambling house?

06:41.280 --> 06:42.920
Because I have
the Meng family behind me.

06:43.480 --> 06:44.720
You're the most powerful
clan in the capital.

06:44.800 --> 06:45.520
With your support,

06:45.600 --> 06:47.840
it means I hold the backing
of all the major noble clans.

06:50.440 --> 06:51.560
I used to be afraid too.

06:52.280 --> 06:54.200
But after that incident, I realized

06:54.960 --> 06:55.840
Father fears

06:57.120 --> 06:58.760
the power of the nobility.

07:00.880 --> 07:02.080
Your Highness, mind your words.

07:02.160 --> 07:02.880
Why?

07:03.880 --> 07:05.000
It's just the two of us here.

07:05.080 --> 07:06.120
I can say whatever I want!

07:08.080 --> 07:09.280
Even if I made a mistake,

07:09.760 --> 07:11.040
I'm still the Crown Prince.

07:11.560 --> 07:13.560
And you, you're the eldest
son of Chancellor Meng.

07:14.440 --> 07:17.560
As long as we stand together,
what do we have to be afraid of?

07:19.080 --> 07:21.360
But silver mines differ
fundamentally from gambling dens.

07:22.120 --> 07:24.360
That incident could be passed
off as a personal misstep.

07:24.680 --> 07:25.520
But the mine

07:26.400 --> 07:27.600
is the lifeblood of the nation.

07:28.880 --> 07:29.760
You must

07:30.120 --> 07:31.400
tread carefully now.

07:31.640 --> 07:32.480
Any aggressive mining

07:33.200 --> 07:35.720
would be most unwise
at a time like this.

07:38.920 --> 07:39.440
Huaijin,

07:40.880 --> 07:42.080
I know what I'm doing.

07:42.880 --> 07:44.120
This discussion ends here.

07:49.840 --> 07:50.560
Aside from this,

07:51.640 --> 07:53.160
is there anything else you're planning?

07:53.600 --> 07:54.120
Huaijin,

07:56.880 --> 07:57.960
like I said,

07:59.280 --> 07:59.960
I know

08:00.360 --> 08:01.560
what I'm doing.

08:08.320 --> 08:09.160
This is outrageous!

08:09.520 --> 08:10.720
This isn't recruitment,

08:10.800 --> 08:11.960
this is outright abduction!

08:12.040 --> 08:13.280
Have they no regard for the law?

08:14.880 --> 08:15.960
I'll write a petition

08:16.280 --> 08:17.080
to Censor Zhou.

08:17.240 --> 08:18.360
He's known for his integrity.

08:18.600 --> 08:19.600
He'll help those people.

08:19.680 --> 08:21.560
Then don't waste another moment,
write it now.

08:23.040 --> 08:24.400
But a petition alone won't suffice.

08:24.680 --> 08:26.320
We need witnesses
and tangible evidence.

08:28.600 --> 08:29.320
Witnesses?

08:29.880 --> 08:31.880
Our entire village will testify.

08:33.120 --> 08:34.039
As for evidence,

08:34.240 --> 08:35.480
tell me what you need,

08:35.559 --> 08:36.440
I'll help gather it

08:37.640 --> 08:38.159
Good.

08:54.920 --> 08:56.880
So this is Censor Zhou's residence?

08:57.600 --> 08:58.520
It must be.

08:59.880 --> 09:02.480
I've heard he chose
this humble location specifically

09:02.760 --> 09:03.960
to receive petitions

09:04.680 --> 09:05.840
from villagers at any hour.

09:07.240 --> 09:08.200
There's a saying about him

09:08.280 --> 09:09.520
that's famous throughout Yujing,

09:10.560 --> 09:12.640
'So long as a single soul
remains homeless,

09:13.360 --> 09:14.760
he shall not upgrade his roof'.

09:17.480 --> 09:18.560
With such integrity,

09:18.640 --> 09:20.240
I believe he'll deliver
a fair judgment.

09:24.040 --> 09:25.440
He's out.

09:28.640 --> 09:29.480
I bring grievances

09:29.560 --> 09:31.240
from all 76 households
of Tianshui Village.

09:31.320 --> 09:33.960
We implore you to deliver justice
for these villagers, Censor Zhou.

09:34.640 --> 09:36.600
- Yes.
- Yes, please help.

09:36.680 --> 09:37.880
Please come in

09:37.960 --> 09:38.920
and tell me everything.

09:41.040 --> 09:41.760
Unbelievable.

09:42.960 --> 09:44.360
They dare to kidnap citizens

09:45.200 --> 09:47.080
under the guise of hiring laborers

09:47.520 --> 09:50.040
right under His Majesty's nose,
forcing them into private labor.

09:51.320 --> 09:52.680
Such blatant disregard of the law.

09:55.120 --> 09:57.200
People of Tianshui Village,

09:57.880 --> 10:00.320
I swear I shall prove
worthy of your trust.

10:02.120 --> 10:03.920
We shall await your
favorable reply.

10:06.240 --> 10:08.480
Thank you, Censor Zhou.

10:16.320 --> 10:16.880
Chancellor.

10:18.440 --> 10:19.600
Do you think that man and woman

10:19.680 --> 10:21.280
really have a chance
at getting us justice?

10:21.360 --> 10:23.360
Censor Zhou is known far and
wide as a just official.

10:23.440 --> 10:24.400
I think they just might.

10:26.240 --> 10:28.480
Who are this man and woman
you're talking about?

10:28.760 --> 10:31.080
A pair of very good-looking folks.

10:32.960 --> 10:33.720
They're back.

10:37.680 --> 10:38.920
Prince Wuxia and Miss Qingying?

10:40.920 --> 10:41.440
Your High…

10:42.920 --> 10:44.240
- Zhan Lu?
- Young Master, Young Lady.

10:45.600 --> 10:46.560
What are you doing here?

10:47.480 --> 10:48.240
You tell me.

10:48.480 --> 10:50.160
You went behind my back
to search for them,

10:50.240 --> 10:51.600
but the person you were looking for,

10:51.680 --> 10:52.440
I found them first.

10:53.320 --> 10:54.000
Chancellor?

10:55.120 --> 10:55.920
Come with us.

11:03.440 --> 11:04.960
Who knows

11:05.040 --> 11:06.320
where they have run off to?

11:06.680 --> 11:07.680
None of them left a word.

11:08.520 --> 11:10.960
My lady, why don't
you eat with me first?

11:14.960 --> 11:16.240
(Judging by that look,)

11:16.840 --> 11:19.040
(is he still mad with me for
splashing him with water?)

11:24.840 --> 11:25.360
Sir!

11:28.560 --> 11:29.800
Sir, I finally found you.

11:30.000 --> 11:30.760
I'm sorry I'm late.

11:31.680 --> 11:32.200
(Zhan Lu?)

11:33.640 --> 11:34.560
Your timing is perfect.

11:34.880 --> 11:35.520
You're not late.

11:37.560 --> 11:38.680
Not late?

11:39.520 --> 11:41.200
If we hadn't run into
him on the street,

11:41.320 --> 11:43.520
he'd still be wandering around
like a headless chicken.

11:44.160 --> 11:45.320
What have you been up to?

11:45.680 --> 11:47.000
Everyone looks happy.

11:49.760 --> 11:51.120
We heard about the villagers' plight

11:51.200 --> 11:52.720
and filed a report
with the authorities.

11:52.800 --> 11:56.320
- Thank you for helping us.
- Thank you for helping us.

11:57.560 --> 11:59.240
(They filed a report
to the authorities?)

12:01.680 --> 12:03.400
(Oh no. This can't be good.)

12:08.760 --> 12:10.480
You two went to
report to the authorities?

12:11.000 --> 12:12.480
That's right, we did.

12:12.880 --> 12:13.480
Yes.

12:14.360 --> 12:16.040
We submitted our
petition to Censor Zhou.

12:16.160 --> 12:17.760
He's known for his
integrity and fairness,

12:17.840 --> 12:19.080
and he governs with compassion.

12:19.280 --> 12:19.840
I believe

12:20.320 --> 12:21.960
we'll have a verdict soon.

12:25.520 --> 12:26.360
Censor Zhou…

12:27.720 --> 12:29.840
I'm afraid we'll be dead

12:30.080 --> 12:31.560
before this investigation bears fruit.

12:32.800 --> 12:34.000
There's no need for sarcasm.

12:34.440 --> 12:35.520
I've met Censor Zhou myself.

12:36.200 --> 12:37.040
He's a meticulous

12:37.120 --> 12:38.080
and principled official.

12:38.840 --> 12:40.000
With ironclad evidence

12:40.160 --> 12:41.560
and clear facts,

12:41.640 --> 12:43.320
surely he will deliver fair judgement.

12:46.240 --> 12:47.160
Funny, isn't it?

12:48.040 --> 12:49.960
Forced labor under
the pretense of recruitment

12:50.120 --> 12:51.560
has been happening for a while.

12:51.640 --> 12:54.200
And Censor Zhou has been
living in that shabby cottage for years.

12:54.280 --> 12:55.640
You really believe he knew nothing?

12:56.520 --> 12:57.760
This matter's roots run deep.

12:57.840 --> 12:59.320
One careless move affects everything.

12:59.920 --> 13:02.280
Your petition will only
alert the mastermind behind.

13:03.920 --> 13:04.480
Nonsense.

13:10.320 --> 13:11.400
Is that how you see the world?

13:11.480 --> 13:12.840
That everyone has some hidden agenda,

13:12.920 --> 13:14.240
that every official is scheming,

13:14.320 --> 13:15.840
and that everything must be calculated

13:15.920 --> 13:16.960
behind closed doors?

13:19.240 --> 13:20.200
If that's how things are,

13:20.280 --> 13:21.920
what's the point of having officials?

13:22.080 --> 13:23.320
Why bother with laws?

13:23.640 --> 13:25.440
Why have a royal family at all?

13:34.640 --> 13:35.400
Young Master Wuxia,

13:36.560 --> 13:37.840
Chancellor prefers

13:37.920 --> 13:39.600
to handle things his own way.

13:40.840 --> 13:41.920
That may be effective,

13:42.400 --> 13:44.360
but it does hurt the innocent
during the process.

13:49.120 --> 13:50.720
Since Wuxia has acted,

13:51.280 --> 13:52.520
why not wait a little longer?

13:53.640 --> 13:55.760
If this can be resolved
without bloodshed,

13:56.080 --> 13:57.160
wouldn't that be better?

13:58.680 --> 13:59.920
Without bloodshed…

14:02.240 --> 14:05.400
Do you really believe such
a perfect solution exists?

14:05.640 --> 14:06.160
Of course.

14:07.000 --> 14:07.880
According to the law,

14:08.400 --> 14:09.920
we write petitions, present evidence,

14:10.400 --> 14:12.360
and the law decides

14:12.480 --> 14:13.160
what's just.

14:13.760 --> 14:14.640
Only this way

14:15.200 --> 14:16.720
will people trust the system,

14:16.920 --> 14:19.160
and lawbreakers be deterred.

14:19.600 --> 14:21.280
What about what you can't see?

14:22.320 --> 14:25.480
Beyond Tianshui Village, there are
countless others suffering injustice.

14:25.560 --> 14:27.040
Can you file petitions for them all?

14:28.240 --> 14:30.720
Are you going to file a petition
for every single case?

14:32.000 --> 14:33.920
If you don't strike at
the root of the problem,

14:34.200 --> 14:36.760
all you'll end up with are more
and more villages like Tianshui.

14:37.040 --> 14:38.440
But while injustice remains visible,

14:39.160 --> 14:40.760
I cannot turn a blind eye to it

14:41.200 --> 14:43.080
and do nothing like you.

14:43.600 --> 14:45.040
I'll file those petitions one by one.

14:46.040 --> 14:46.720
And case by case,

14:47.480 --> 14:49.120
justice will return.

15:16.600 --> 15:17.280
Censor Zhou.

15:19.120 --> 15:19.920
Well done.

15:21.040 --> 15:21.600
Rise.

15:22.480 --> 15:23.400
Yes, Your Highness.

15:26.280 --> 15:27.880
To be of service to you

15:28.320 --> 15:29.720
is my honor.

15:30.800 --> 15:32.800
So it wasn't Shen Zaiye
who filed the report.

15:33.360 --> 15:34.280
Who was it then?

15:34.920 --> 15:36.560
The man revealed nothing of himself,

15:37.080 --> 15:39.040
but he carried noble bearing

15:39.360 --> 15:41.560
and spoke with Yujing accent.

15:42.080 --> 15:43.840
I took the liberty

15:44.240 --> 15:46.040
of having portraits made
of the man and woman

15:46.280 --> 15:47.400
leading the petitioners.

16:13.840 --> 16:14.960
Go claim your reward.

16:15.480 --> 16:16.000
No.

16:17.080 --> 16:18.560
I ask for no reward.

16:19.240 --> 16:20.600
All I wish is to follow you

16:21.240 --> 16:22.520
wherever you lead, Your Highness.

16:24.720 --> 16:25.360
Censor Zhou,

16:27.000 --> 16:29.200
next year's merit evaluation
will recall you to Yujing.

16:31.040 --> 16:32.400
You might consider revising

16:33.000 --> 16:34.000
your thatched hut story.

16:36.520 --> 16:37.680
Thank you, Your Highness!

16:44.960 --> 16:45.520
Huaijin,

16:46.360 --> 16:47.080
what do you think?

16:53.840 --> 16:55.000
If you ask me…

16:59.720 --> 17:00.320
Your Highness,

17:01.400 --> 17:03.240
haven't I warned you time and again

17:03.320 --> 17:05.520
to let the gambling house incident
end there?

17:07.040 --> 17:09.280
Why did you have to make a move

17:09.359 --> 17:12.480
when you didn't have a foolproof plan
to eliminate Shen Zaiye?

17:13.079 --> 17:14.720
He and that concubine of his

17:15.240 --> 17:17.599
burned my gambling house to ashes.

17:19.520 --> 17:20.880
How could I maintain my dignity

17:21.680 --> 17:22.680
if I didn't make them pay?

17:22.760 --> 17:23.680
And have you succeeded?

17:25.880 --> 17:27.760
Not only did you fail to kill him,

17:28.359 --> 17:30.520
you even drove them
to Tianshui Village.

17:31.800 --> 17:33.280
If you had told me even a day earlier,

17:33.360 --> 17:35.000
we could've still
salvaged the situation.

17:35.680 --> 17:37.440
We could've said you
sent men after them

17:37.520 --> 17:39.400
because Lady Jiang disrespected you.

17:40.120 --> 17:42.000
But now, with Prince Wuxia involved,

17:42.080 --> 17:42.800
this has become…

17:46.240 --> 17:48.080
An inescapable deadlock.

17:50.160 --> 17:50.680
Huaijin,

17:52.680 --> 17:53.600
what do we do now?

18:05.720 --> 18:08.280
Their prolonged stay
in Tianshui Village

18:09.840 --> 18:11.320
suggests they've uncovered clues

18:11.400 --> 18:12.560
about the dirty money.

18:13.120 --> 18:14.520
Stop the recruitment operations.

18:14.840 --> 18:15.920
Abandon the village.

18:18.280 --> 18:20.360
Your Highness,

18:21.320 --> 18:22.360
please send assassins

18:23.600 --> 18:25.800
and kill them all.

18:32.800 --> 18:34.320
Chancellor, it's just as you suspected.

18:34.640 --> 18:36.720
As soon as Prince Wuxia
and Miss Qingying left today,

18:37.160 --> 18:38.760
Censor Zhou also left his cottage.

18:39.600 --> 18:40.280
I'm afraid…

18:41.520 --> 18:42.400
I anticipated as much.

18:43.160 --> 18:45.400
When I investigated through
the labor recruitment scheme,

18:45.720 --> 18:47.440
I noticed they seemed
aware of our probing.

18:49.360 --> 18:50.240
Foreman, we have a problem.

18:50.320 --> 18:51.240
My name is Zhao Dashan.

18:51.320 --> 18:53.680
- I'm 25.
- Vegetables! Fresh vegetables!

18:53.760 --> 18:54.560
(Labor Recruitment)

18:54.640 --> 18:56.360
- You can leave now! Go, go!
- Vegetables!

18:56.560 --> 18:57.760
We're not hiring anymore.

18:57.920 --> 18:58.520
Move along now.

18:59.280 --> 19:00.040
Not hiring anymore?

19:00.800 --> 19:01.400
Seriously?

19:01.480 --> 19:03.160
(Not long after
Prince Wuxia filed the report,)

19:03.240 --> 19:04.960
(they shut down
recruitment immediately.)

19:05.520 --> 19:07.400
(The Crown Prince
must've found out I'm here.)

19:08.680 --> 19:09.680
They moved so quickly.

19:10.520 --> 19:11.920
It has to be Meng Huaijin's idea.

19:14.160 --> 19:14.800
Gather our men

19:14.880 --> 19:16.200
and have them converge
here immediately.

19:16.280 --> 19:17.400
We must prepare for the worst.

19:17.480 --> 19:18.040
Yes, sir.

19:20.080 --> 19:21.360
(The Crown Prince's vigilance)

19:22.040 --> 19:23.160
(means he's about to strike.)

19:23.960 --> 19:25.280
(With them hidden and us exposed,)

19:25.600 --> 19:26.920
(I have to lay my plans early.)

19:39.880 --> 19:40.440
Your Highness.

19:42.080 --> 19:43.280
You haven't eaten anything

19:43.600 --> 19:44.680
since you returned.

19:45.560 --> 19:46.520
Have a little something.

20:04.280 --> 20:05.560
When I was little,

20:06.880 --> 20:08.320
I was terribly picky about food.

20:09.280 --> 20:11.280
No delicacies could tempt my appetite,

20:12.160 --> 20:14.360
except for the taro
my mother used to make.

20:15.160 --> 20:16.640
That, I would eat with great delight.

20:18.400 --> 20:19.360
She had no choice

20:19.960 --> 20:21.320
but to cook it in all sorts of ways

20:21.680 --> 20:23.080
just to keep me fed.

20:24.200 --> 20:25.560
But ever since she passed,

20:26.440 --> 20:27.680
I haven't had it in a long time.

20:30.320 --> 20:31.080
What a coincidence.

20:33.080 --> 20:33.960
Back in Beiyuan,

20:34.280 --> 20:35.680
my brother and I often ate that too.

20:36.640 --> 20:38.920
No wonder you remind me so much of him.

20:39.680 --> 20:41.880
Perhaps we were fated to meet.

20:43.240 --> 20:43.920
To be honest,

20:44.680 --> 20:46.280
when I first saw you,

20:46.360 --> 20:47.880
I too felt an inexplicable familiarity.

20:49.000 --> 20:50.240
If you don't mind,

20:50.800 --> 20:52.760
you could think of me
as your younger brother.

20:53.120 --> 20:54.800
And I'll think of you
as my elder sister.

20:55.360 --> 20:56.400
I'd love that.

21:01.680 --> 21:04.840
Young Master, are you still
troubled by what happened today?

21:07.320 --> 21:09.000
When I've made up
my mind about something,

21:09.520 --> 21:10.200
I don't waver.

21:14.840 --> 21:15.960
When I heard

21:16.240 --> 21:17.440
what you said earlier,

21:18.280 --> 21:19.520
it was like a jolt of clarity.

21:20.520 --> 21:22.360
Your integrity and sincerity

21:22.760 --> 21:24.040
moved me deeply.

21:26.720 --> 21:29.360
If this can indeed be resolved properly

21:29.920 --> 21:31.960
through official channels as you said,

21:32.760 --> 21:34.400
it would be most comforting.

21:37.160 --> 21:38.080
However,

21:39.080 --> 21:40.280
I actually agree

21:40.640 --> 21:42.440
with Chancellor's position.

21:43.640 --> 21:44.920
We held off from reporting this

21:45.200 --> 21:46.360
from the beginning

21:46.840 --> 21:49.360
because we feared collusion
between officials.

21:50.480 --> 21:52.920
We'd only make things worse
if we alerted the wrong people.

21:53.800 --> 21:54.880
I understand your concerns.

21:56.600 --> 21:57.280
However,

21:58.280 --> 22:00.240
without rules, there can be no order.

22:01.200 --> 22:02.360
Without laws,

22:03.000 --> 22:04.960
power knows no bounds,

22:05.760 --> 22:07.160
the strong will oppress the weak,

22:07.240 --> 22:08.760
and the nation will descend into chaos.

22:10.040 --> 22:11.720
We who hold power

22:12.280 --> 22:13.880
must abide by the law ourselves,

22:14.240 --> 22:15.240
or the law

22:15.800 --> 22:16.880
becomes meaningless.

22:18.240 --> 22:19.720
How can we speak of governing a nation

22:20.120 --> 22:21.280
without legal constraints?

22:22.480 --> 22:23.920
This is precisely why I insist on

22:24.960 --> 22:25.880
due process.

22:29.400 --> 22:30.520
Your commitment to justice

22:31.280 --> 22:32.440
puts me to shame.

22:36.400 --> 22:37.520
Actually, all of this

22:38.520 --> 22:40.200
was taught to me
by someone from my past.

22:41.040 --> 22:41.960
Someone from your past?

22:43.640 --> 22:44.160
Yes.

22:45.040 --> 22:47.000
He taught me music, chess,
calligraphy, painting,

22:47.360 --> 22:48.280
poetry recitation,

22:49.040 --> 22:50.760
and the wisdom of the sages.

22:51.360 --> 22:53.160
I'm merely following
the path he illuminated.

22:53.880 --> 22:54.880
Was this person

22:55.080 --> 22:56.920
one of your childhood tutors?

23:00.560 --> 23:01.440
My cousin.

23:03.240 --> 23:03.920
Your cousin?

23:05.360 --> 23:05.880
Yes.

23:09.560 --> 23:10.520
My cousin

23:12.160 --> 23:13.320
was a genius.

23:14.160 --> 23:16.520
He's the person I've spent
my life trying to measure up to.

23:17.760 --> 23:18.920
Therefore the empire values…

23:19.840 --> 23:20.760
Repeat after me.

23:21.040 --> 23:22.480
Govern the nation with righteousness.

23:22.560 --> 23:23.400
Wage war with strategy.

23:23.480 --> 23:25.240
Win the world by keeping
the people at peace.

23:25.320 --> 23:27.480
Cousin, what does that mean?

23:28.760 --> 23:30.720
It means, only through
righteous governance

23:31.080 --> 23:32.600
can a nation avoid chaos.

23:33.080 --> 23:34.280
Only through tactical ingenuity

23:34.400 --> 23:36.000
can armies secure victory.

23:36.440 --> 23:38.440
And only by ruling without
oppressing the people

23:38.680 --> 23:40.480
can an empire know lasting peace.

23:42.360 --> 23:43.600
My cousin's family

23:44.120 --> 23:45.240
were distinguished scholars,

23:45.440 --> 23:46.640
generations of loyal officials

23:47.360 --> 23:49.240
serving our dynasty
with unwavering devotion.

23:50.080 --> 23:51.920
Yet because of my mother's incident,

23:53.120 --> 23:54.800
his family was implicated
and slaughtered.

23:56.160 --> 23:57.760
Kill everyone in the Xie family!

23:58.280 --> 23:58.800
Kill them!

24:01.000 --> 24:01.520
Dear!

24:03.600 --> 24:04.120
Dear!

24:07.520 --> 24:12.600
(Xie)

24:16.520 --> 24:17.360
I never imagined

24:17.680 --> 24:19.040
you had such a past.

24:19.960 --> 24:20.800
Where is

24:21.240 --> 24:22.600
your cousin now?

24:25.320 --> 24:26.240
He's long gone.

24:56.760 --> 24:57.840
You little brat!

24:58.040 --> 24:59.320
You tricked us last time.

24:59.480 --> 25:00.480
Try pulling that again today

25:00.560 --> 25:01.560
and I'll skin you alive!

25:01.800 --> 25:03.240
No tricks this time.

25:03.520 --> 25:06.040
I fooled Shen Zaiye into
going alone to chop wood.

25:36.280 --> 25:36.880
Sir, please…

25:39.520 --> 25:40.600
What did you feed me?

25:40.920 --> 25:42.360
You're going to do something for me.

25:42.720 --> 25:43.320
What is it?

25:44.080 --> 25:45.400
Take me to where you work.

25:45.640 --> 25:47.120
No way! Absolutely not!

25:48.240 --> 25:49.440
Do you really have a choice now?

25:49.520 --> 25:50.040
I…

25:50.720 --> 25:52.720
I know your master is
keeping an eye on you.

25:52.800 --> 25:54.680
All you need to do is pass me
off as your servant

25:54.760 --> 25:55.720
and take me in.

25:56.040 --> 25:57.960
The rest isn't your concern.

25:58.160 --> 25:59.680
But what about the poison?

25:59.840 --> 26:00.760
Complete the task,

26:01.200 --> 26:02.360
and you'll get the antidote.

26:02.840 --> 26:03.920
Alright, alright.

26:40.040 --> 26:41.240
Lian?

26:43.200 --> 26:43.760
Lian?

26:43.840 --> 26:44.400
Madam.

26:46.720 --> 26:47.600
What's wrong?

26:48.560 --> 26:50.200
I'm looking for Lian.

26:50.600 --> 26:52.760
Who knows where she's run off to play?

26:53.040 --> 26:54.840
It's getting dark.
Why hasn't she come home?

26:55.080 --> 26:56.120
Don't worry.

26:56.520 --> 26:58.480
She's probably just lost track of time.

26:58.560 --> 26:59.400
You don't understand,

26:59.480 --> 27:01.200
there are wild animals
in these mountains.

27:01.560 --> 27:03.920
It gets dangerous at night.

27:05.040 --> 27:07.320
But she's usually so responsible.

27:07.400 --> 27:09.040
I don't know what
got into her this time.

27:09.480 --> 27:10.520
I'd better go look for her.

27:11.360 --> 27:12.200
Lian?

27:13.280 --> 27:14.160
Lian?

27:15.680 --> 27:16.840
Lian?

27:28.240 --> 27:29.280
(That's…)

27:31.040 --> 27:31.920
(Blood.)

27:35.240 --> 27:36.120
I never forgive those

27:36.840 --> 27:37.840
who betray me.

27:38.960 --> 27:40.800
She may have failed
to harm me this time,

27:40.920 --> 27:42.680
but who's to say
there won't be a next time?

27:43.880 --> 27:44.520
Being young

27:45.760 --> 27:46.960
is no excuse for wrongdoing.

27:48.840 --> 27:50.720
(Shen Zaiye has always
lived by one rule,)

27:50.800 --> 27:52.600
(better to betray others
than be betrayed.)

27:54.520 --> 27:55.360
(Did he…)

28:06.840 --> 28:07.560
What's the matter?

28:08.840 --> 28:10.560
We haven't seen Lian all day.

28:11.080 --> 28:12.320
Don't you find that strange?

28:12.760 --> 28:14.440
Children lose track
of time when playing.

28:14.520 --> 28:15.600
What's strange about that?

28:19.400 --> 28:20.120
Lian

28:21.080 --> 28:22.440
did betray us once before.

28:23.320 --> 28:24.480
And your methods…

28:27.760 --> 28:29.080
You think I killed her?

28:29.480 --> 28:30.640
That's not what I meant.

28:30.800 --> 28:31.520
I was only saying…

28:31.600 --> 28:32.960
So what if I did?

28:35.120 --> 28:36.600
I've always been petty.

28:36.680 --> 28:38.040
I never tolerate traitors.

28:39.120 --> 28:40.320
Just like you.

28:41.040 --> 28:42.680
Playing the loyal ally on one hand,

28:43.080 --> 28:45.680
while hiding the other half of the
Sunlight over a Thousand Peaks.

28:45.760 --> 28:47.360
Were you planning
to use it as leverage?

28:48.280 --> 28:49.240
Schemes like that

28:50.120 --> 28:51.720
are reason enough for me to kill you.

28:57.160 --> 28:58.320
You saw

28:59.160 --> 29:00.080
the painting

29:00.760 --> 29:01.560
in my sleeve?

29:01.880 --> 29:02.720
Otherwise

29:03.080 --> 29:03.840
I might never

29:03.920 --> 29:05.360
have realized how masterful

29:05.680 --> 29:07.320
your acting has become.

29:08.080 --> 29:09.640
You had me completely fooled.

29:10.600 --> 29:11.440
Truly impressive.

29:11.520 --> 29:12.240
Chancellor,

29:12.760 --> 29:13.920
- I…
- Do you

29:14.160 --> 29:14.880
honestly think

29:15.680 --> 29:17.240
I'd believe another word from you?

29:28.480 --> 29:30.080
For your own safety,

29:30.800 --> 29:31.520
I suggest you

29:32.480 --> 29:35.080
stay put and do your work properly.

30:15.480 --> 30:16.000
Granny!

30:16.280 --> 30:17.240
Qingying took me to town

30:17.320 --> 30:19.080
and bought me these sugar rolls.

30:19.600 --> 30:21.000
It's so delicious, and we got a lot!

30:21.360 --> 30:21.920
Really?

30:22.000 --> 30:22.520
Have some.

30:23.360 --> 30:24.800
It's alright. You can have them all.

30:25.040 --> 30:25.920
Just try some.

30:27.160 --> 30:27.880
Alright.

30:40.320 --> 30:41.880
(I misunderstood him.)

30:42.880 --> 30:45.960
(But where did that blood
on his robe come from?)

31:10.280 --> 31:11.280
What are you doing here?

31:18.240 --> 31:20.320
I misunderstood you earlier.

31:20.760 --> 31:21.640
I'm here to apologize.

31:22.600 --> 31:24.600
You haven't eaten since you returned.

31:26.120 --> 31:26.920
Here, have a peach.

31:36.160 --> 31:36.920
Chancellor,

31:37.840 --> 31:40.000
I had my reasons for keeping
that half of the painting.

31:41.400 --> 31:42.400
But I swear,

31:42.960 --> 31:44.640
I would never do anything to harm Qi

31:44.960 --> 31:46.240
or you.

31:47.080 --> 31:48.200
If I break this vow,

31:48.800 --> 31:50.520
may I never see my family again.

32:01.600 --> 32:04.040
That's the most solemn oath I can make.

32:05.480 --> 32:07.280
Do you still not believe me?

32:11.000 --> 32:12.240
She is just a maid.

32:13.000 --> 32:14.000
Is she really worth this?

32:14.440 --> 32:15.400
Qingtai is never

32:15.480 --> 32:16.480
just a maid to me,

32:16.840 --> 32:17.640
she's my family.

32:19.240 --> 32:20.360
Mother…

32:20.920 --> 32:21.800
Don't leave me.

32:34.920 --> 32:35.720
You may go back now.

32:36.760 --> 32:37.920
It's going to be a long night.

32:39.120 --> 32:41.880
Why don't I come with you tonight?

32:44.040 --> 32:44.920
Come with me?

32:45.880 --> 32:46.720
Aren't you afraid

32:46.920 --> 32:48.600
I'm off to commit murder and mayhem?

32:48.840 --> 32:49.560
So what?

32:50.120 --> 32:51.880
I was never a virtuous person
to begin with.

32:52.600 --> 32:54.200
If you're out pillaging,

32:54.760 --> 32:56.360
I'll be the one

32:56.440 --> 32:57.360
handing you the knives.

33:02.240 --> 33:03.040
Besides,

33:03.640 --> 33:05.600
Lian told me

33:05.760 --> 33:07.480
what you were going to do tonight.

33:08.000 --> 33:10.040
You used her to find the foreman

33:10.320 --> 33:12.080
and forced him
to take you to the worksite.

33:12.960 --> 33:15.160
You're tracing
the source of the dirty money.

33:15.280 --> 33:16.480
That's something righteous.

33:17.200 --> 33:19.000
I admire you more than I can even say.

33:19.440 --> 33:21.640
Why would I fear walking beside you?

33:26.240 --> 33:26.960
Is that a yes?

33:28.720 --> 33:30.000
Sir, I'm here.

33:30.800 --> 33:31.400
Sir,

33:31.720 --> 33:33.640
why is there an extra person?

33:34.240 --> 33:35.120
What does it matter?

33:35.520 --> 33:36.240
Take us there now.

33:36.440 --> 33:38.040
Yes, yes, please come with me.

33:53.440 --> 33:55.240
Can we really trust this man?

33:55.920 --> 33:57.280
What if it's a trap?

33:57.800 --> 33:59.200
You seem so calm.

34:00.000 --> 34:01.400
Did you already make arrangements?

34:01.920 --> 34:02.680
Smart.

34:06.240 --> 34:07.880
I've had Zhan Lu
position reinforcements.

34:08.679 --> 34:10.560
At best, we uncover the truth tonight.

34:11.159 --> 34:11.760
At worst,

34:12.639 --> 34:13.960
we buy time for the villagers.

34:14.440 --> 34:15.560
Buy time?

34:15.639 --> 34:16.360
What do you mean?

34:17.080 --> 34:18.760
I've instructed Qingying
and Prince Wuxia

34:19.239 --> 34:20.440
to standby outside the village.

34:20.960 --> 34:22.080
At the first sign of danger,

34:22.440 --> 34:23.520
they'll evacuate everyone.

34:26.080 --> 34:27.080
Zaiye was right after all.

34:27.159 --> 34:28.880
He cares about the people?
What a load of crap!

34:28.960 --> 34:30.280
He's just another rotten official!

34:30.960 --> 34:32.040
Good thing we were prepared.

34:33.600 --> 34:34.639
Let's go warn everyone now.

34:34.840 --> 34:35.360
Come on.

34:35.880 --> 34:37.159
Given the Crown Prince's nature,

34:37.520 --> 34:38.520
knowing we're here,

34:38.679 --> 34:39.960
he'll stop at nothing to kill us.

34:40.080 --> 34:41.199
He won't leave anyone alive.

34:46.880 --> 34:48.080
(As I expected, they're here.)

34:52.800 --> 34:53.320
Watch out!

35:16.840 --> 35:18.200
They're here faster than expected,

35:18.760 --> 35:20.200
which means we found the right place.

35:21.520 --> 35:22.680
I just didn't anticipate

35:23.600 --> 35:24.600
they'd send so many men.

35:35.800 --> 35:37.440
Zhan Lu and our men
must've been held up.

35:37.600 --> 35:40.360
Let's hope Qingying and the Prince
can evacuate the villagers in time.

35:40.720 --> 35:42.040
Sir, Madam, come out!

35:42.440 --> 35:42.960
Mr. Zhang!

35:43.200 --> 35:43.760
Open the door!

35:46.040 --> 35:48.080
Someone's here to kill everyone! Run!

35:50.480 --> 35:51.000
Oh, no.

35:51.200 --> 35:52.720
I forgot your brother's stuff.

35:52.880 --> 35:54.640
- Go with them first.
- You have to hurry, Granny!

35:54.720 --> 35:55.760
Come on, we have to go!

36:04.480 --> 36:05.440
Kill them!

36:05.840 --> 36:06.360
Look out!

36:22.000 --> 36:22.720
Die!

36:35.720 --> 36:36.520
You're hurt.

36:36.760 --> 36:37.760
You'll hold me back. Go!

36:38.600 --> 36:39.440
- But…
- Go.

36:40.840 --> 36:41.360
Go!

36:48.560 --> 36:50.080
Go after her! Don't let her get away!

36:51.480 --> 36:52.120
Nowhere to run!

36:59.600 --> 37:00.880
Careful, mind your steps.

37:04.280 --> 37:04.800
Wei Wuxia.

37:05.520 --> 37:06.280
Is everyone here?

37:08.680 --> 37:09.600
Qingying,

37:10.000 --> 37:11.560
is my granny with you?

37:12.360 --> 37:13.440
Isn't she with you?

37:16.520 --> 37:17.040
Lian,

37:17.840 --> 37:18.360
listen,

37:18.440 --> 37:20.080
take everyone southeast

37:20.440 --> 37:21.440
through the bamboo grove.

37:21.520 --> 37:22.440
There's a house there.

37:22.920 --> 37:24.600
Wait for me and Qingying there.

37:24.720 --> 37:26.040
We'll be right behind you, alright?

37:26.120 --> 37:27.440
How do you know about that place?

37:29.000 --> 37:29.880
Your brother told me.

37:31.600 --> 37:33.480
You have to bring my Granny back.

37:35.560 --> 37:36.080
Don't worry.

37:36.480 --> 37:37.800
Everyone, follow me.

37:40.280 --> 37:41.280
- Come.
- Come.

37:41.800 --> 37:42.320
Come on.

37:42.520 --> 37:43.160
Easy.

37:44.200 --> 37:44.880
Follow them.

37:50.120 --> 37:51.240
Stop right there!

38:15.240 --> 38:16.400
Get her! Kill her!

38:29.120 --> 38:30.120
(Jiang Taohua!)

38:38.520 --> 38:39.440
There's nowhere to run!

38:42.080 --> 38:42.600
(Oh, no.)

38:43.320 --> 38:44.480
(I'm caught in the weeds.)

38:47.160 --> 38:48.560
(What do I do?)
(I can't get free.)

38:57.920 --> 38:58.880
(Help!)

38:59.880 --> 39:00.680
(Somebody!)

39:32.480 --> 39:35.680
♪ The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all ♪

39:35.760 --> 39:38.800
♪ In splendor, proud and tall ♪

39:39.720 --> 39:42.880
♪ The flower fell, lashed by the wind ♪

39:42.960 --> 39:46.720
♪ In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned ♪

39:47.000 --> 39:50.120
♪ Petals soaked in rain ♪

39:50.200 --> 39:53.520
♪ Heartbreak follows again and again ♪

39:53.920 --> 39:57.480
♪ The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts ♪

39:57.560 --> 40:03.280
♪ With no one it can be brought ♪

40:08.240 --> 40:15.160
♪ Wishes struggle through the mire ♪

40:15.600 --> 40:22.440
♪ Regrets clash in hopeless fire ♪

40:22.920 --> 40:29.920
♪ Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew ♪

40:30.240 --> 40:34.320
♪ Even if it means this flower ♪

40:34.400 --> 40:41.360
♪ Will be hers to give to someone new ♪

40:52.480 --> 40:55.600
♪ Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet? ♪

40:55.680 --> 40:58.920
♪ Love and hate held back, discreet ♪

40:59.280 --> 41:03.000
♪ The flower withers, feelings in decay ♪

41:03.080 --> 41:09.640
♪ No longer needing to say ♪

41:13.720 --> 41:20.640
♪ Yet I still long for her in madness ♪

41:21.040 --> 41:28.000
♪ Unafraid of judgment or sadness ♪

41:28.360 --> 41:35.360
♪ Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies ♪

41:35.720 --> 41:37.400
♪ And finding ♪

41:37.480 --> 41:46.480
♪ They were her gentle heart's reply ♪
